#: ../../library/asyncio.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`asyncio` --- asynchronous I/O scheduler"
msgstr ":mod:`asyncio` --- 异步 I/O 调度器"

#: ../../library/asyncio.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module provides a cooperative-multitasking scheduler for "
"``async``/``await`` coroutines, along with primitives for synchronisation "
"(locks, events) and non-blocking TCP networking via stream readers and "
"writers.  Tasks are run concurrently on a single event loop; the currently "
"running task yields control back to the loop with ``await``."
msgstr ""
"本模块为 ``async``/``await`` "
"协程提供了一个协作式多任务调度器，并提供了用于同步的原语（锁、事件）以及通过流读取器和写入器实现的非阻塞 TCP "
"网络功能。任务在单个事件循环上并发运行；当前正在运行的任务通过 ``await`` 将控制权交还给循环。"

